{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在上方最大号的白色标题，紫色强调的“不再需要他陪”“不自在了呢”很醒目；随后视线容易被中间灰白色大标题和下方金黄色强调的大字吸引。右上角目录和辅助说明文字不是主要入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他开始具体担心对方有一天不再需要自己陪伴，甚至不愿意和自己待在一起；但他此刻的实际处境还不够明确。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"没底、担忧、不安。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他因此突然安静下来，不敢继续往下想；之后又想起对方一直没有退开，两人仍然亲近，于是有了一点高兴。这种从不安到重新获得一点安慰的情绪变化，第一眼不容易完整抓到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"三块字号接近、都比较醒目的大字分布在上中下，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在担心、突然安静、回想亲近这几块内容里，需要拼接才能理解情绪变化及其关系。\",\n    \"上方标题是较长的问句，包含具体担忧和假设情境，快速扫视未必能完整拿到。\",\n    \"下方金黄色强调的“这些都是真的”“有点高兴”本身醒目，但需要结合前面的内容才能理解它为什么带来高兴。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c9263402-ddf9-4e3b-832c-d34b2db0a34f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T011238673026Z", "elapsed_seconds": 29.265, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:13:07.936084+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "728c935d7841f15734c6737df4d0d9dbf2b85211f876334ade6f493aed892493", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7f